(Grant of Easement) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For consideration of $72,000.00, Grantor grants Grantee a permanent easement 30 feet in) Tj
T*
(width to construct, operate, maintain, inspect, replace, and remove one pipeline for the) Tj
T*
(transportation of oil, gas, water, and related substances, with appurtenant valves and) Tj
T*
