T*
(No. 456, Dimmit County, Texas, the centerline being as staked and as shown on the plat) Tj
T*
(attached as Exhibit A. The right-of-way traverses approximately 1558 rods \(5.75 acres of) Tj
T*
(permanent working space\).) Tj
T*
(Depth, Double-Ditching, and Restoration) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The pipeline shall be buried a minimum of 48 inches below the surface and below the plow) Tj
T*
(depth of cultivated land. Grantee shall double-ditch so that topsoil is separated and) Tj
T*
(returned to the surface, repair fences, drainage, and terraces, re-seed annually until) Tj
T*
(vegetation is re-established, and pay for growing crops and timber actually damaged.) Tj
